  "summary": "Front bumper (the split front bumper bars) and bumper guards (front bumperettes), the license plate bracket at the front center, and the bumper extensions that tie the bumper ends to the outer braces at the fender skirt opening. The bumper is bolted to the brace and member assemblies from sheet A2; the license plate bracket is screwed to the brace; the guard is held through the bumper with a special washer. Bumper height and clearances are set to the sheet-metal checking dimensions (UPC 11-13).",
