  "notes_internal": [
    "Bolt [3]/nut [4] at the top-left brace end: which part they hold is not clear; the brace and member asms are from sheet A2.",
    "Bolt [20] (rev 3) and the bracket marked (4): the bracket it holds is not called out; label 'SUPPORT (SEE UPC 13)' points at it.",
    "Guard [18] fastening: drawing shows only washer [17] behind the bumper; stud/nut not identifiable.",
    "Circled (2) near the bumper bracket under the bumper = revision 2 (bumper drawing revised). Circled 3 next to torque 4 = revision 3.",
    "Item 7 'BUMPER' is a small rubber bumper on the license bracket, not the bumper bar.",
    "Title block: drawing 3965172; L- 82104, 82137; DR /C1, CK 5-2-69 C1, PREL 4-28-69, C/O A2 (sheet box A3); model 19000. Sideways 'K280'. AUTH 23589 AW (rev 1), 25948 EL (rev 3); CK C1 (rev 2), HB? (rev 4)."
